it includes) is distributed with ICU.

ICU4X (src/temporal_calendar.cpp)
---------------------------------

The tables of the Chinese and Korean calendars' years from 1900 to 2102
(sChineseYears and sDangiYears: each year's new year, months' lengths and
leap month) are derived from ICU4X's data
(https://github.com/unicode-org/icu4x, components/calendar/src/cal/
east_asian_traditional/qing_data.rs, china_data.rs and korea_data.rs),
Copyright © 2020-2024 Unicode, Inc., licensed under the Unicode License V3
(the licence above; SPDX-License-Identifier: Unicode-3.0). Changes: the data
are packed into C++ tables of 32-bit values.

TC39 proposal-math-sum (src/builtins_basic.cpp)
-----------------------------------------------

Math.sumPrecise (math_sum_precise) follows the algorithm of the proposal's
reference implementation (https://github.com/tc39/proposal-math-sum,
polyfill/polyfill.mjs, by Kevin Gibbons): Shewchuk's exact summation with its
handling of intermediate overflow (partials kept as multiples of 2^1024) and
of the final rounding. Changes: translated from JavaScript to C++. (The
repository has no licence file of its own.)
